note=\"9b641c11eab6e875\" href=\"?note=9b641c11eab6e875\" title=\"17-df-assignment\">17-df-assignment</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"3.1"},{"key":"source_result","html":"elementary-embedding convention"},{"key":"source_pages_print","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>136</span><span>137</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pages_djvu","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>152</span><span>153</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"statement-compared; local equivalent formulation"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-catalog"},{"key":"legacy_label","html":"17-df-1.4.2"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 为语言；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\">\\(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" href=\"?note=fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" title=\"17-df-structure\">17-df-structure</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Form}_L\">\\(\\mathrm{Form}_L\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"465b5002eb16d1cf\" href=\"?note=465b5002eb16d1cf\" title=\"17-df-formula\">17-df-formula</a>；总赋值集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Assign}(|\\mathfrak A|)\">\\(\\mathrm{Assign}(|\\mathfrak A|)\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sat}_L\">\\(\\mathrm{Sat}_L\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"9b641c11eab6e875\" href=\"?note=9b641c11eab6e875\" title=\"17-df-assignment\">17-df-assignment</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"ec1305482f8eec2e\" href=\"?note=ec1305482f8eec2e\" title=\"17-df-satisfaction\">17-df-satisfaction</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\circ s\">\\(f\\circ s\\)</span> 是通常的函数复合。此处定义初等嵌入集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ElemEmb}_L(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)\">\\(\\operatorname{ElemEmb}_L(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ElemEmb}_L(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)\\coloneqq\n\\{f:|\\mathfrak A|\\to|\\mathfrak B|:\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_L\\;\\forall s\\in\\mathrm{Assign}(|\\mathfrak A|)\\;\n(\\mathrm{Sat}_L(\\mathfrak A,s,\\varphi)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Sat}_L(\\mathfrak B,f\\circ s,\\varphi))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ElemEmb}_L(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)\\coloneqq\n\\{f:|\\mathfrak A|\\to|\\mathfrak B|:\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_L\\;\\forall s\\in\\mathrm{Assign}(|\\mathfrak A|)\\;\n(\\mathrm{Sat}_L(\\mathfrak A,s,\\varphi)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Sat}_L(\\mathfrak B,f\\circ s,\\varphi))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>总赋值表达与原书 §3.1 的有限元组表达等价，依据 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"ee38febe67086306\" href=\"?note=ee38febe67086306\" title=\"17-lem-satisfaction-coincidence\">17-lem-satisfaction-coincidence</a>。对等式公式应用定义即得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 单射。必要记号均由前两节决定。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"465b5002eb16d1cf","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-free-variable","status":"resolved","id":"58507ea1921a657e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-free-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"fdac06af5a7f3bb5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-structure]]",